    "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a labyrinth filled with dangers.</h2></strong><br>Deadly traps, constant pressure, time is against you: every second counts to move forward. Will you be able to escape the multiple threats and regain your freedom?<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SYNOPSIS</h2></strong><br>You wake up in an unknown room that seems to belong to a much larger complex. You don't know who you are, what you have to do, or why you are there. However, you will quickly understand that this place is hostile!<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OBJECTIVE OF THE GAME</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore your environment to understand your situation<br></li><li>Survive the dangers that surround you<br></li><li>Search for and use many objects to help you<br></li><li>Find a way to escape from this place</li></ul>",
